    Redis -->|"subscribe"| S1
    Redis -->|"subscribe"| S2
    S1 -.->|"로컬 세션에만 전송"| UA
    S2 -.->|"로컬 세션에만 전송"| UB
    S1 --> DB[("PostgreSQL")]
    S2 --> DB
    classDef store fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#34d399,color:#064e3b
